domain VT104_READINESS:
  description "Correct local startup readiness signaling."
evidence FAILURE:
  "Full unit run observes ECONNREFUSED at first health fetch after child stdout API listening."
evidence SOURCE:
  "backend/src/index.ts console.log API listening executes before serve() invocation. Startup test uses that message as readiness then immediately fetches."
premise ALTERNATIVE_EXIT:
  "Child might have exited or unrelated process resource pressure might contribute. Existing isolated success does not eliminate timing race. Child diagnostics on failure are incomplete."
decision PRODUCING_CONDITION based_on FAILURE, SOURCE:
  "The readiness signal can precede socket binding, allowing a correct observer of the signal to connect too early. This source condition explains the observed race; exact scheduling of this occurrence is inferred."
pending OTHER_FAILURES:
  "No production failure or auth regression is established. Unit selection overlapped Seal refresh, so rerun only after refresh completion."
decision CORRECT based_on SOURCE, PRODUCING_CONDITION, ALTERNATIVE_EXIT:
  "Move readiness logging into serve listening callback, retaining startup behavior and existing regression. Repeat isolated startup then complete selected suite after authority refresh. Local correction is within implementation/test authority."
